    'audience.close': 'REROUTE supports routine organization and does not replace medical, nutrition, or fitness professional guidance.',
    'audience.featureTitle': 'Using or considering injectable weight-loss medication?',
    'audience.featureBody': 'Medication can be part of the process with professional guidance. But training, nutrition, hydration, and routine still need organization.',
    'audience.featureHighlight': 'Medication can support weight loss. REROUTE helps organize the journey.',
    'audience.featureNote': 'REROUTE does not prescribe medication or replace medical, nutrition, or professional guidance.',
    'process.kicker': 'How it works', 'process.title': 'A clear route from your starting point to today’s plan.', 'process.lead': 'REROUTE turns context into practical actions and supports the adjustments needed throughout the journey.',
    'process.title1': 'We understand your starting point', 'process.body1': 'You share your goal, routine, challenges, and current context.',
    'process.title2': 'We chart a personalized route', 'process.body2': 'REROUTE organizes an initial direction for training, nutrition, hydration, and habits.',
    'process.title3': 'You receive the daily plan', 'process.body3': 'Your next actions appear in a simple, practical format.',
    'process.title4': 'The route adjusts when needed', 'process.body4': 'When reality changes, the system reorganizes the next possible step.',
    'process.title5': 'Your progress stays recorded', 'process.body5': 'You track consistency, adjustments, and progress over time.',
    'organizes.kicker': 'Your routine in one route', 'organizes.title': 'What REROUTE organizes', 'organizes.lead': 'The elements that most influence consistency are connected without requiring a perfect routine.',
    'organizes.name1': 'Training', 'organizes.body1': 'A routine organized around your current moment and availability.',
    'organizes.name2': 'Nutrition', 'organizes.body2': 'Practical direction for staying consistent without relying on perfection.',
    'organizes.name3': 'Hydration', 'organizes.body3': 'Daily goals and water intake tracking.',
    'organizes.name4': 'Routine', 'organizes.body4': 'Adjustments when schedules, energy, or commitments change.',
    'organizes.name5': 'Daily support', 'organizes.body5': 'Check-ins that reveal what worked and what needs recalculating.',
    'founder.kicker': 'Founder story', 'founder.title': 'REROUTE also began with a route that needed recalculating.', 'founder.body': 'During my own weight-loss process, I realized the problem was not simply knowing what to do. The real challenge was continuing when routine, fatigue, and unexpected events changed the plan. REROUTE was created to organize that journey and help other people avoid turning a detour into giving up.', 'founder.photo1': 'Real process', 'founder.photo2': 'Founder journey',
    'problem.kicker': 'Your reality', 'problem.title': 'How many times have you believed this time would be different?', 'problem.lead': 'You started a method, downloaded an app, bought a course, or set new goals. It worked for a few days. Then life happened.',
    'problem.title1': 'The rhythm breaks', 'problem.body1': 'Work intensifies, fatigue arrives, problems appear, and what once seemed simple begins to demand energy you no longer have.',
    'problem.title2': 'Guilt appears', 'problem.body2': 'You look at the abandoned plan and think you lacked discipline. But perhaps the problem was never a lack of willpower.',
    'problem.title3': 'Reality changes', 'problem.body3': 'Most solutions expect you to carry on alone, even when your routine, energy, and priorities are no longer the same.',
    'solution.kicker': 'The turning point', 'solution.title': 'Plans change. Life happens. REROUTE keeps going.', 'solution.lead': 'REROUTE was created for a world where nothing stays the same. It learns from your journey, adapts to your reality, and helps you make the best decision for the moment you are living.',
    'solution.quote': '“You did not fail. The route simply needs to be recalculated.”', 'solution.node1': 'You tell us where you are', 'solution.nodeBody1': 'No performance, no judgment, and no need to pretend everything is under control.',
    'solution.node2': 'The detour becomes clear', 'solution.nodeBody2': 'The system helps separate what happened, what weighs on you now, and what truly needs attention.',
    'solution.node3': 'A next step emerges', 'solution.nodeBody3': 'An action you can take today, proportionate to your reality and connected to the destination that still matters.',
    'rota.kicker': 'ROTA Method', 'rota.title': 'Four movements to keep moving forward.', 'rota.name1': 'Recognize reality', 'rota.body1': 'Understand your routine, energy, nutrition, and execution as they are today.',
    'rota.name2': 'Observe without judgment', 'rota.body2': 'Identify what is working and what is making progress harder.', 'rota.name3': 'Trace a new route', 'rota.body3': 'Choose realistic adjustments that keep you moving forward.',
    'rota.name4': 'Act on the next step', 'rota.body4': 'Turn the plan into one clear action for today.',
    'hns.kicker': 'Human Navigation System', 'hns.title': 'More than an app: a navigation system for goals.',
    'hns.lead': 'REROUTE starts with health, helping people organize their weight-loss route. The long-term vision is to build a Human Navigation System capable of supporting different human goals by recognizing context, decisions, change, and progress.',
    'hns.item1': 'A GPS shows how to reach an address.', 'hns.item2': 'REROUTE helps you keep moving forward when reality changes.', 'hns.item3': 'The technology organizes context, next steps, and progress.',
    'hns.name1': 'Calendar', 'hns.body1': 'It organizes schedules, but does not understand why you lost momentum when your routine changed.', 'hns.name2': 'Apps', 'hns.body2': 'They organize tasks, but often keep demanding execution when what you need is direction.',
    'hns.name3': 'Courses', 'hns.body3': 'They teach methods, but do not walk with you on the days when life interrupts the method.', 'hns.body4': 'It follows your journey and helps you adapt the route when reality changes.',
    'promise.kicker': 'The promise', 'promise.title': 'REROUTE does not promise to change your life all at once.', 'promise.lead': 'It promises something more solid: to help you make better decisions throughout the journey. Major changes rarely happen in a single leap. They grow from thousands of small, clearer decisions.',
    'promise.item1': 'A better decision today can change tomorrow’s direction.', 'promise.item2': 'A mistake is an event, not an identity.', 'promise.item3': 'The next step matters more than the last detour.',
